sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Employee (Voice)
    participant Eleven as ElevenLabs Playbook Agent
    participant Webhook as FastAPI Webhook (/elevenlabs/webhook)
    participant GPT as GPTService (Tool Dispatcher)
    participant Service as Domain Service (Ticket/Auth/Software)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / SQLite Database

    Caller->>Eleven: Speaks "I need Docker Desktop for microservices development"
    Eleven->>Eleven: Converts Speech-to-Text & Selects tool `request_access`
    Eleven->>Webhook: POST /api/v1/elevenlabs/webhook (X-ElevenLabs-Secret)
    Webhook->>Webhook: Verify Webhook Secret Token
    Webhook->>GPT: execute_tool_call("request_access", parameters)
    GPT->>Service: SoftwareService.request_software_access()
    Service->>DB: Query User & Evaluate Rule Engine ("Docker" -> "Pending Approval")
    Service->>DB: INSERT into software_requests table
    DB-->>Service: Record Saved
    Service-->>GPT: Return Success & Speech Text
    GPT-->>Webhook: Return Tool Result
    Webhook-->>Eleven: Return HTTP 200 JSON {"status": "success", "response": "..."}
    Eleven->>Caller: Text-to-Speech: "Your request for Docker Desktop has been logged..."
